    "name": "The Roast - Coffee Shop Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3561900,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/4baffb37d8b9f6b4cad978df60e0e07a.avif?t=1755614542\" width=676 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/211a3f450909f87de85276a08b0901d3.poster.avif?t=1755614542\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/211a3f450909f87de85276a08b0901d3.webm?t=1755614542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/211a3f450909f87de85276a08b0901d3.mp4?t=1755614542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once stuck behind a desk in a soulless 9-to-5 job, those days are now behind you! You and your friends are finally chasing the dream of opening your very own coffee shop. Nestled in the heart of the city, this charming little space\u2014snatched up at a bargain\u2014holds the potential to become the hottest caf\u00e9 in town. Now it\u2019s time to roll up your sleeves and turn that dream into reality!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/4775dfdaec9b9d81c5b83b468eba6be6.avif?t=1755614542\" width=676 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you\u2019ll need to prepare customer orders quickly and accurately. Every cup of coffee reflects a player\u2019s unique style. This phase tests your timing, teamwork, and memory skills as you collect customer satisfaction points and grow your caf\u00e9!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/223f330fbf73965e7d179d7aea518857.avif?t=1755614542\" width=676 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add exciting new coffee recipes, adjust prices, and source delicious pastries from nearby bakeries to diversify your offerings. Your menu decisions affect both your profits and your customer base. Choose wisely to build a loyal following!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/0b06a7487e8db8911ce2d0431bdf75cf.avif?t=1755614542\" width=676 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/5046118c8045d6d7078d8d651b83101a.poster.avif?t=1755614542\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/5046118c8045d6d7078d8d651b83101a.webm?t=1755614542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/5046118c8045d6d7078d8d651b83101a.mp4?t=1755614542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rent, supply costs, staff wages... Staying profitable at the end of each day is up to you. Make strategic choices to expand your shop!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/150c86a66f331356547809c3eb97da83.avif?t=1755614542\" width=676 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the same coffee shop together and enjoy the team spirit, or spice up the fun by \u2018bullying\u2019 your friends a little  coffee-filled entertainment awaits!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/0f459890b9b890a91b05a3adf32390c8.avif?t=1755614542\" width=676 height=150 /></span></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/4baffb37d8b9f6b4cad978df60e0e07a.avif?t=1755614542\" width=676 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/211a3f450909f87de85276a08b0901d3.poster.avif?t=1755614542\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/211a3f450909f87de85276a08b0901d3.webm?t=1755614542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/211a3f450909f87de85276a08b0901d3.mp4?t=1755614542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once stuck behind a desk in a soulless 9-to-5 job, those days are now behind you! You and your friends are finally chasing the dream of opening your very own coffee shop. Nestled in the heart of the city, this charming little space\u2014snatched up at a bargain\u2014holds the potential to become the hottest caf\u00e9 in town. Now it\u2019s time to roll up your sleeves and turn that dream into reality!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/4775dfdaec9b9d81c5b83b468eba6be6.avif?t=1755614542\" width=676 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you\u2019ll need to prepare customer orders quickly and accurately. Every cup of coffee reflects a player\u2019s unique style. This phase tests your timing, teamwork, and memory skills as you collect customer satisfaction points and grow your caf\u00e9!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/223f330fbf73965e7d179d7aea518857.avif?t=1755614542\" width=676 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add exciting new coffee recipes, adjust prices, and source delicious pastries from nearby bakeries to diversify your offerings. Your menu decisions affect both your profits and your customer base. Choose wisely to build a loyal following!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/0b06a7487e8db8911ce2d0431bdf75cf.avif?t=1755614542\" width=676 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/5046118c8045d6d7078d8d651b83101a.poster.avif?t=1755614542\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/5046118c8045d6d7078d8d651b83101a.webm?t=1755614542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/5046118c8045d6d7078d8d651b83101a.mp4?t=1755614542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rent, supply costs, staff wages... Staying profitable at the end of each day is up to you. Make strategic choices to expand your shop!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/150c86a66f331356547809c3eb97da83.avif?t=1755614542\" width=676 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the same coffee shop together and enjoy the team spirit, or spice up the fun by \u2018bullying\u2019 your friends a little  coffee-filled entertainment awaits!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561900/extras/0f459890b9b890a91b05a3adf32390c8.avif?t=1755614542\" width=676 height=150 /></span></h2>",
